---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/blank-canvas.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="boomley — problems become signals" description="boomley is a two-person product company and growing community for turning meaningful problems into products worth building.">
  <div class="boot" data-boot aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="boot__count"><span data-boot-count>000</span>%</div>
    <div class="boot__phrase" data-boot-phrase>PROBLEM.</div>
    <div class="boot__logo" data-boot-logo>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="18" y="10" width="28" height="7" rx="3.5" class="sig"/>
        <path d="M20 19C20 16.8 21.8 15 24 15h3c2.2 0 4 1.8 4 4v10.1c2.8-2.2 6.2-3.3 9.8-3.1C49.2 26.5 54 32.1 54 40c0 8.6-6.1 14-15.6 14H24c-2.2 0-4-1.8-4-4V19Zm11 19v7h7c3.8 0 6-2.1 6-5.3 0-3-2.2-5-5.6-5-3.2 0-5.7 1.1-7.4 3.3Z"/>
      </svg>
      <span>boomley</span>
    </div>
    <div class="boot__welcome" data-boot-welcome>WELCOME.</div>
  </div>

  <header class="nav" data-nav>
    <a class="nav__brand" href="#top" aria-label="boomley home">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="18" y="10" width="28" height="7" rx="3.5" class="sig"/>
        <path d="M20 19C20 16.8 21.8 15 24 15h3c2.2 0 4 1.8 4 4v10.1c2.8-2.2 6.2-3.3 9.8-3.1C49.2 26.5 54 32.1 54 40c0 8.6-6.1 14-15.6 14H24c-2.2 0-4-1.8-4-4V19Zm11 19v7h7c3.8 0 6-2.1 6-5.3 0-3-2.2-5-5.6-5-3.2 0-5.7 1.1-7.4 3.3Z"/>
      </svg>
      <span>boomley</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav__links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#builds">Builds</a>
      <a href="#community">Community</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="nav__signal" href="#signal-box">Send a signal ↗</a>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="kicker">A PRODUCT COMPANY / A PUBLIC WORKBENCH / A GROWING COMMUNITY</p>
        <h1>
          Problems are
          <span>everywhere.</span>
          We pay attention.
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__deck">boomley notices the problems people keep learning to live with — then investigates the ones worth turning into products.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__media" data-founder-rotator>
        <figure class="hero-photo hero-photo--a" data-founder-photo="chidi">
          <img src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi, Product" width="2048" height="2048" />
          <figcaption>PRODUCT</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="hero-photo hero-photo--b" data-founder-photo="michael">
          <img src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael, Engineering" width="2048" height="2048" />
          <figcaption>ENGINEERING</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="hero__scribble hero__scribble--one">TWO PEOPLE.<br/>FOR NOW.</div>
        <div class="hero__scribble hero__scribble--two">EST. 2026</div>

        <div class="signal-module">
          <small>SIGNAL RECEIVER / 01</small>
          <strong>LISTENING</strong>
          <div class="signal-module__meter"><i></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__foot">
        <span>02 PEOPLE</span>
        <span>01 ACTIVE BUILD</span>
        <span>THE BOX IS OPEN</span>
        <a href="#about">TRACE THE SIGNAL ↓</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ticker__track">
        <span>PROBLEM</span><b>→</b><span>THOUGHT</span><b>→</b><span>IDEA</span><b>→</b><span>SIGNAL</span><b>→</b><span>boomley</span>
        <span>PROBLEM</span><b>→</b><span>THOUGHT</span><b>→</b><span>IDEA</span><b>→</b><span>SIGNAL</span><b>→</b><span>boomley</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="about" class="about">
      <div class="chapter"><span>01</span><b>ABOUT</b><p>We don't start with apps. We start by asking whether the problem deserves one.</p></div>

      <div class="about__layout">
        <div class="about__story">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h2>It starts with a <em>problem.</em></h2>
            <p>Something takes too long. Feels unnecessarily difficult. Makes people invent workarounds.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h2>Then a <em>thought.</em></h2>
            <p>Why does it work this way? Why has everybody accepted it?</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h2>Then an <em>idea.</em></h2>
            <p>Not necessarily a product yet. Just the possibility that something could be better.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <h2>Then a <em>signal.</em></h2>
            <p>When the pattern repeats, boomley starts listening more closely.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="scanner" data-scanner>
          <div class="scanner__top"><span>LIVE SIGNAL INTERPRETATION</span><span>001</span></div>
          <canvas class="scanner__canvas" data-scanner-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <div class="scanner__scope">
            <div class="scanner__reticle" data-reticle><span>SEARCHING</span></div>
            <p>Noise is everywhere.<br/>The pattern is the interesting part.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="scanner__bottom"><span>PROBLEM → THOUGHT → IDEA</span><b>SIGNAL</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process" class="process">
      <div class="chapter chapter--dark"><span>02</span><b>HOW WE WORK</b><p>One continuous loop. No theatre.</p></div>

      <div class="process__shell">
        <div class="process__copy">
          <h2>We don't start<br/>with <em>apps.</em></h2>
          <p>We start by asking whether the problem deserves one.</p>

          <div class="process__nav" role="list">
            <button class="is-active" data-step="0"><span>01</span>NOTICE</button>
            <button data-step="1"><span>02</span>LISTEN</button>
            <button data-step="2"><span>03</span>QUESTION</button>
            <button data-step="3"><span>04</span>BUILD</button>
            <button data-step="4"><span>05</span>TEST</button>
            <button data-step="5"><span>06</span>LISTEN AGAIN</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process__stage">
          <article class="step is-active" data-step-panel="0">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>01 / NOTICE</span><h3>Find repeated friction rather than isolated annoyance.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--notice" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>?</b></div>
          </article>
          <article class="step" data-step-panel="1">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>02 / LISTEN</span><h3>Understand who experiences it and what it costs them.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--listen" aria-hidden="true"><div class="wave wave--a"></div><div class="wave wave--b"></div><div class="wave wave--c"></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="step" data-step-panel="2">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>03 / QUESTION</span><h3>Decide whether software should exist at all.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--question" aria-hidden="true"><div class="question-mark">?</div><div class="grid"></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="step" data-step-panel="3">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>04 / BUILD</span><h3>Product and engineering turn the strongest signal into something tangible.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--build" aria-hidden="true"><div class="window w1"></div><div class="window w2"></div><div class="window w3"></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="step" data-step-panel="4">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>05 / TEST</span><h3>Reality gets the final vote.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--test" aria-hidden="true"><span>PASS</span><span>FAIL</span><i></i></div>
          </article>
          <article class="step" data-step-panel="5">
            <div class="step__copy"><span>06 / LISTEN AGAIN</span><h3>The loop starts over.</h3></div>
            <div class="scene scene--loop" aria-hidden="true"><div class="loop-ring r1"></div><div class="loop-ring r2"></div><div class="loop-ring r3"></div></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="history">
      <div class="chapter"><span>03</span><b>HISTORY</b><p>No mythology. No fake milestones. Just the actual beginning.</p></div>
      <h2>You found us <span>early.</span></h2>

      <div class="history__line">
        <article><span>2026</span><h3>Two disciplines meet.</h3><p>Product management and software engineering begin exploring recurring frustrations together.</p></article>
        <article><span>SIGNAL / 001</span><h3>Research begins.</h3><p>The first problem becomes serious enough to document rather than just discuss.</p></article>
        <article class="is-now"><span>NOW</span><h3>Building in public.</h3><p>Research, systems, experience design and the first private build are taking shape.</p></article>
        <article><span>NEXT</span><h3>Test with people.</h3><p>Let real users challenge the assumptions before anything deserves a launch.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="people" id="people">
      <div class="chapter"><span>04</span><b>PEOPLE</b><p>Two people. Two disciplines. One shared intolerance for unnecessary friction.</p></div>
      <h2>Who's actually<br/>opening the box?</h2>

      <div class="people__gallery" data-people-rotator>
        <article class="person" data-person="chidi">
          <div class="person__visual">
            <img src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi" width="2048" height="2048" />
            <canvas data-founder-ascii="chidi" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <div class="person__overlay"><span>PRODUCT</span><b>ASKS WHY.</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="person__meta"><b>CHIDI</b><span>Product management / strategy / research / experience</span></div>
        </article>

        <article class="person" data-person="michael">
          <div class="person__visual">
            <img src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael" width="2048" height="2048" />
            <canvas data-founder-ascii="michael" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <div class="person__overlay"><span>ENGINEERING</span><b>MAKES IT REAL.</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="person__meta"><b>MICHAEL</b><span>Software engineering / systems / architecture / build</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="people__note">HOVER A PORTRAIT / THE MACHINE INTERPRETS THE HUMAN.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="builds" class="builds">
      <div class="chapter chapter--dark"><span>05</span><b>BUILDS</b><p>WE FOUND OUR FIRST SIGNAL.</p></div>

      <div class="builds__hero">
        <span>PRIVATE BUILD / SIGNAL 001</span>
        <h2>1000001</h2>
        <p>We're not explaining it yet. We're documenting it, questioning it and building it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="builds__collage">
        <article class="artifact artifact--paper">
          <small>RESEARCH / 001</small>
          <h3>ATTENTION WAS FRAGMENTED BEFORE WE TRIED TO FIX IT.</h3>
          <p>Research artifact / selected note</p>
        </article>

        <article class="artifact artifact--ui">
          <div class="ui__bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>private build</span></div>
          <div class="ui__body">
            <small>1000001 / INTERNAL</small>
            <h3>ONE THING.<br/>STAY WITH IT.</h3>
            <div class="ui__rail"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="artifact artifact--note">
          <small>RULE / 07</small>
          <h3>THE TOOL SHOULD NOT BECOME THE TASK.</h3>
        </article>

        <div class="builds__ascii" aria-hidden="true">
          <pre>00110010
01001010
01110101
01110011
01110100</pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="builds__status">
        <div><span>RESEARCH</span><b>COMPLETE</b></div>
        <div><span>DOCUMENTATION</span><b>ACTIVE</b></div>
        <div><span>EXPERIENCE</span><b>ACTIVE</b></div>
        <div><span>BUILD</span><b>NEXT</b></div>
        <div><span>TEST</span><b>LATER</b></div>
      </div>

      <form class="waitlist" name="product-1000001" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="product-1000001" />
        <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
        <label for="product-email">Want to be there when 1000001 opens?</label>
        <div><input id="product-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="ENTER EMAIL" required autocomplete="email" /><button type="submit">KEEP ME CLOSE ↗</button></div>
        <p class="status" data-product-status aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id="community" class="community">
      <div class="chapter"><span>06</span><b>COMMUNITY</b><p>boomley is becoming a home for problem-noticers, developers, designers, researchers, students, founders and people who are simply curious enough to ask why something still works this way.</p></div>

      <div class="community__headline">
        <h2>Some people <span>notice things.</span></h2>
        <h2>Some people <span>build them.</span></h2>
        <p>We want both.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="community__mosaic" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mosaic mosaic--people"><span>PEOPLE</span><div class="dots"></div></div>
        <div class="mosaic mosaic--why"><span>WHY?</span><b>WHY?</b><strong>WHY?</strong></div>
        <div class="mosaic mosaic--code"><span>BUILDERS</span><pre>00101
11010
01011
10100</pre></div>
        <div class="mosaic mosaic--signal"><span>SIGNAL</span><b>↗</b></div>
        <div class="mosaic mosaic--listen"><span>LISTEN</span><div class="listening-wave"></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="community__actions">
        <a href="#signal-box">I HAVE A PROBLEM →</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">I WANT TO BUILD →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="signal-box" class="signal">
      <div class="chapter"><span>07</span><b>SEND A SIGNAL</b><p>Don't pitch us an app. Tell us what shouldn't still be this difficult.</p></div>

      <div class="signal__head">
        <h2>What have <span>you</span> noticed?</h2>
        <div class="signal__steps"><b><i>01</i>WRITE THE PROBLEM.</b><b><i>02</i>WRAP THE LETTER.</b><b><i>03</i>POST IT.</b></div>
      </div>

      <div class="signal__workspace">
        <form class="letter" name="boomley-signal" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-signal-form>
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="boomley-signal" />
          <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
          <div class="letter__head"><span>boomley / signal form</span><span>001</span></div>
          <h3>WHAT'S BOTHERING YOU?</h3>
          <p>Write the problem. We'll worry about the product.</p>
          <label>THE PROBLEM<textarea name="friction" rows="4" required placeholder="It shouldn't still be this difficult to..."></textarea></label>
          <label>WHO DEALS WITH IT?<input name="who" type="text" required placeholder="People who..." /></label>
          <label>WHAT CHANGES IF IT'S FIXED?<textarea name="change" rows="2" required placeholder="It would make it easier to..."></textarea></label>
          <label>YOUR EMAIL<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" /></label>
          <div class="letter__actions"><button type="button" data-wrap>WRAP IT →</button><button type="submit" data-post disabled>POST IT →</button></div>
          <p class="status" data-signal-status aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>

        <div class="posting">
          <div class="envelope" data-envelope aria-hidden="true"><div class="envelope__paper">SIGNAL / READY</div><div class="envelope__flap"></div><span>TO / boomley</span></div>
          <div class="postbox" data-postbox>
            <div class="postbox__cap"></div>
            <div class="postbox__body">
              <div class="postbox__badge">b</div>
              <div class="postbox__slot"><span>POST SIGNAL</span></div>
              <div class="postbox__plaque"><b>boomley</b><small>SIGNAL RECEIVER / 001</small></div>
              <div class="postbox__door"><span>THE BOX IS OPEN</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="postbox__base"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="finale">
      <canvas data-ending-field aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div class="finale__copy">
        <span>SIGNALS EXIST EVERYWHERE.</span>
        <h2>This is only<br/><em>the beginning.</em></h2>
        <p>We're listening.</p>
        <div class="finale__brand">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="18" y="10" width="28" height="7" rx="3.5" class="sig"/><path d="M20 19C20 16.8 21.8 15 24 15h3c2.2 0 4 1.8 4 4v10.1c2.8-2.2 6.2-3.3 9.8-3.1C49.2 26.5 54 32.1 54 40c0 8.6-6.1 14-15.6 14H24c-2.2 0-4-1.8-4-4V19Zm11 19v7h7c3.8 0 6-2.1 6-5.3 0-3-2.2-5-5.6-5-3.2 0-5.7 1.1-7.4 3.3Z"/></svg>
          <b>boomley</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer__brand"><b>boomley</b><p>Problems become signals. Signals become things.</p></div>
    <div><span>EXPLORE</span><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#builds">Builds</a><a href="#community">Community</a></div>
    <div><span>PARTICIPATE</span><a href="#signal-box">Send a Signal</a><a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">Contact</a></div>
    <div><span>LEGAL</span><a href="#">Privacy</a><a href="#">Terms</a><small>© 2026 boomley</small></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    import '../scripts/blank-canvas.ts';
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
